        "en": "One screenshot (any device family) is required. Up to 10 desktop screenshots and up to 8 for other device families, uploaded separately for each listing language. PNG, up to 50 MB each, landscape or portrait. Optional caption up to 200 characters. At least four per supported device family is recommended."
